WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:08.930
Those dirty little... This hurts!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.580
Those monsters...

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.850
And that kid...

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.840
I'll kill them all!

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.170
Hey...

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.260
You gotta be kidding me!

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:50.190
I never heard anything about this... this...

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.600
monster!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.010
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.540
Bell Cranel
The Fool

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.480
Don't know what he's thinking, 
but it doesn't matter!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.080
Hey! Let's get this done!

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.200
Firebolt!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:04.760
Huh?

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:11.050
<i>It will end.</i>

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.490
<i>One wrong move here...</i>

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:17.230
<i>And Bell Cranel will become 
the enemy of humanity.</i>

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.660
Th-This is my catch...

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.560
This vouivre is my catch! 
So no one touches it!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.780
Bell-kun...

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.830
Um, so... What's happening?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:59.940
Among adventurers, it is a violation of 
manners to step in and take another's prey.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:03.550
Oh! A vouivre's a rare monster, 
right? Now that you mention it...

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.750
You gotta be kidding me! 
That's when we're in the Dungeon!

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.580
There is no need to abide 
by the whims of children.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:12.400
After it!

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.940
Armed monsters?

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.280
It seems this is not unrelated to the 
uproar over the destruction of Livira.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.440
Ais, you stay here.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.550
Is something wrong?

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.620
Just a little. My thumb, you see...

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:34.740
There's something bothering me.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.560
Take them alive, if you can!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.500
Take them alive?

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.520
Man, now Finn's telling us 
to go the annoying route.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.900
Stop screaming!

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.170
This isn't somewhere you can 
just do whatever you want!

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:03.360
Sh-She's strong! Completely 
different from other adventurers!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.060
But...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.980
I can't let myself be beaten!

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.300
You don't seem to be a simple lizardman.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.410
Hmm...

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:21.930
It's a goblin, but probably around Level 4?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.170
This is bad.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.410
At this rate...

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.490
I am sorry, Ouranos. I am going to use it.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.380
What is that?

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.980
Is it an ally of these others?

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.580
How would I know?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.800
It is a golem made entirely of adamantite.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.300
A secret weapon I have held in reserve!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:02.530
Everyone, out of the way! Out of the way!

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.540
I've been waiting for something like this!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.540
Here I come!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.280
See? See? I did it!

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.870
Tiona, you idiot! The commander said 
to bring them in alive, didn't he?

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:23.720
Huh?

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.250
It's no good, Ouranos.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.810
The Loki Familia are, by far,
 the monsters here.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.470
Hopeless. Looks like I got 
the short straw here.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.210
Are you the mastermind behind this?

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.900
I know not why a god would 
lead monsters, but...

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:48.930
It matters not.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:49.870
You will come with me.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.950
All right, all right. Carry me gently, okay?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.680
Thank you for your aid, Lord Hermes.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:03.210
It was nothing. The way things are right now,
 we really need your power...

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:04.600
Sage.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.310
Now, I am "The Fool." I am Fels.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:12.660
Then, Fels, right now, Bell-kun is alone.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.470
Won't you go help him for me?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:16.970
But the Xenos...

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.330
No! You can't!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.700
Come on! Let go, Li'l Lili!

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.010
At this rate, the Xenos will...

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.740
You can't!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.140
With Bell-sama, things were left hazy,

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.400
but if we are seen defending monsters again,

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.020
this time, the Hestia Familia really will...

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:14.290
A Howl...

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.270
Haruhime-kun! Miss Supporter!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.630
Dodge, Tione!

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:29.640
Tione!

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:36.070
A black... minotaur.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.950
Asterius...

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.120
You...

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:03.830
Running riot like this? 
Quit pushing your luck, you big cow!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.690
I'll make mincemeat out of you!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.280
It's smiling...

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.010
Run!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.670
A magic sword?

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:24.670
Embrace us...

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:25.120
Riveria!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.740
Become the protecting light
 of the forest and save us.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.290
My name is Alf!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.580
Via Shillheim!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.340
I-I've gone numb?

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.560
Paralysis?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.880
We're done with trying to bring it in alive.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.700
Get him, Ais.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:23.860
Understood.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.150
Tempest...

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:35.600
Aerial.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.360
Let's go.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:16.570
That is... the War Princess.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.390
Ais Wallenstein...

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.580
You say you remember this 
minotaur from somewhere?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.510
It's...

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:31.410
No.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:34.320
But... No, it couldn't be.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.840
To think it could keep pace with 
Ais in a fight to this extent.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.280
Gareth...

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.790
Stand down, Ais!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.900
I can't let you cross such a dangerous 
bridge with your hand like that!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.110
Right, Finn?

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.580
Right. We need to make absolutely sure.

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:16.540
Pincer, Gareth!

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.330
This smoke, it's winding around us.

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.050
A magic item?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.290
We misjudged it...

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.330
It's our defeat.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:23.850
Wiene! Stop!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.400
Wiene!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.270
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.770
<i>I want to help her!</i>

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:38.800
There it is!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.400
It's coming through!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:44.670
Don't!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.610
Firebolt!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.890
Little Rookie, you little...

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:58.080
What d'you think you're doing?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:13:59.770
It's coming!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:00.980
Firebolt!

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:03.240
Stop, Wiene!

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.400
Wiene!

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:35.650
Wiene!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.760
Bell...

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:57.910
I killed it... I killed it!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.450
Wiene!

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:04.590
It's collapsing!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.260
I did it, Dix.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.940
I killed the monster! I killed it! Me!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.010
Wiene...

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:51.050
Wiene!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.270
No...

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:13.020
You can't!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.320
Bell?

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.450
I'm... sorry.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:24.950
It's okay.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.170
Everything's all right.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.270
I'm all right.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.300
So, please... Wiene...

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.090
I have this dream...

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:40.790
What?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:45.680
No one comes to save me... 
It's a scary dream.

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:48.800
But you know?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.650
This time...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.770
Someone did come to save me.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.580
I'm so happy...

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.690
Bell...

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:39.730
I love you.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.600
O, untrodden land. O, forbidden wall.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.200
Today, on this day, I turn my 
back on the rule of the heavens.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.150
Rod of Pius. Bowl of Salus.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.810
O, voice, you who no powers 
of healing can reach,

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:21.530
I beg of you to wait.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.260
What is this light?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.340
A god returning?

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:35.780
No... That's not it.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.840
Have you used that, then, Fels?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.630
Magic which transcends human knowledge...

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.390
Wonder what's going to happen now.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:49.060
A miracle, no doubt.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.470
Endless tears. The sound of 
singing scatters and fades.

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.720
The price has already been paid.

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.170
O, path of light,

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.270
receive the prescribed past as sacrifice,

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.610
I wish for you to illuminate a foolish plea.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.210
Oh, I cannot look back.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.260
Dia Orpheus!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.700
This is the first time... I have succeeded.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:03.490
Eight hundred years... Honestly!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:06.380
I cursed this magic for 
its uselessness, but...

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.760
There was a purpose to it after all.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:42.560
They did it. I'm so glad!

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.530
Wiene... Wiene!

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.830
Bell-san... Thank you so much.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.530
Bell Cranel.

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:54.710
Thanks to you, the Xenos were saved.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:57.740
It is no lie. You saved Wiene, too.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.180
I am grateful to you, as well.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:01.910
I...

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.010
I am sure... you must have regrets.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:08.880
He...

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:12.340
The adventurer with the goggles said...

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:14.720
"You are a hypocrite."

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:18.010
This is what I think.

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:21.370
It is those who are spoken 
ill of as hypocrites

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:23.810
that have the right to become heroes.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:25.340
In the past,

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:30.280
there have been many who bore strange ties 
to the Xenos and showed them kindness.

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:32.070
However,

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:34.480
someone like you who shows 
no regard for himself,

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:37.870
and simply rushes to their aid... 
not a single one was like that.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:41.880
I, who have lost both skin and muscle,
 say this to you...

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:45.610
I, to whom only bones and regrets remain...

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:47.050
I say this to you.

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:49.260
Be a fool,

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:51.150
Bell Cranel.

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:56.390
What you possess is extraordinarily foolish,

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.400
but I am certain it is something 
precious and irreplaceable.

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:06.100
Eina-san...

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:10.580
Through a selfish decision, you exposed 
the city and its people to danger,

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.920
and other adventurers suffered injury.

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:15.880
Is that true?

00:23:19.900 --> 00:23:20.870
Yes.

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:25.430
I don't believe it.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:32.570
I could never believe that!

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Stigma
Downfall</b>

00:23:37.590 --> 00:23:38.730
Next time,

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:39.810
"Stigma."
